The BOPU may serve upon an Industrial User an order (written direction or verbal statement) requiring
specific actions be taken to verify compliance or return to compliance. Orders may contain a required timeline for
actions to be completed by the Industrial User.  Orders may appear within a letter, inspection forms, inspection
reports, Notice of Violations, Consent Orders, Administrative Compliance Orders, or any other type of enforcement
