A.  The control authority BOPU may immediately suspend an Industrial User's discharge whenever such
suspension is necessary to stop an actual or threatened discharge, which reasonably appears to present, or
cause an imminent or substantial endangerment to the health or welfare of persons. The control authority
BOPU may also immediately suspend an Industrial User's discharge, after notice and opportunity to respond,
that threatens to interfere with the operation of the POTW, or which presents, or may present, an
endangerment to the environment.
1.  Any Industrial User notified of a suspension of its discharge shall immediately stop or eliminate its
